5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know how this affects our time! I'll look into the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network. It's important to understand the financial side of this reorganization.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'll check the drawn plan against the staff survey and what this year's two joiners reported. We need to be fair about the seating and understand how our current layout affects new members.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll check the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check. Physical comfort and the environment are often overlooked in these plans.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'll look into the arrival times in the badge records and the two project strands within earshot last spring! I want to see how our seating affects how we talk to each other.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Does anyone else think we should check the joiners' reports? Mizuki is doing it, but I wonder if they mentioned anything about how long it took them to get settled in!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,Mizuki has that covered. I believe the current distribution of our research is sufficient to cover the primary concerns of the team. Let's see what the data reveals.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Toshio. We have a good spread of information coming in. I'm particularly interested to see if the staff survey highlights any specific grievances we can resolve with this new layout.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I'm satisfied with the current selection. Let's avoid redundant efforts and focus on the data. I'll stick with my choices to ensure the actual quality of the workspace is quantified.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm excited to see what we find! I think we've got all the bases covered, from the budget to our comfort and how we interact. I can't wait to hear everyone's results!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm just so curious! I hope the pilot floor isn't too chaotic. If it takes forever to set up every morning, we should definitely think about that before we decide!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Efficiency is key. If the setup process is cumbersome, it will impact our productivity. We should remain objective and wait for the actual findings before drawing any conclusions.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"It is important that we don't let our assumptions lead us. Once we have the facts, we can ensure the final decision is balanced and doesn't unfairly burden any one person.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Exactly. Logic should dictate the layout, not just a desire for change. I expect the data on sound and ergonomics to be the most telling factors for our daily performance.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I agree! I just hope we find a way to make sure everyone feels connected. It'll be so interesting to see if sitting closer actually helps us work better together!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready! Let's get the answers and figure out the best way to sit. I hope we find something that makes everyone happy and doesn't waste any of our time!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I am also ready. Let us proceed to the findings so we can evaluate the options based on concrete data rather than speculation.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I am ready as well. Let's see what the information reveals so we can make a decision that is fair and sustainable for everyone in the team.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,I'm ready. Let's see if the reality of the environment matches our expectations. I look forward to seeing how the data shapes the options we'll be considering.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Yumi,,Me too! I'm all set and ready to see what we've discovered. Let's find the perfect spot for everyone!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
