60,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option A sounds like a nightmare with those ten-minute setups! Option B with all those boxes is also bad. I vote for Option C! It's the fastest and simplest way!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option A is a daily waste of time, and Option B would incur repeated facilities charges and operational chaos. Option C is the only fiscally responsible and efficient choice. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Option A is unfair to late arrivals, and Option B doesn't solve the daylight issue permanently. Option C allows us to consciously assign seats to ensure fairness. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shion,,"Option A is a disaster for ergonomics and noise control, and Option B is a physical nightmare. Stability is non-negotiable for our health and focus. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"Option A is unfair to those who arrive late, and Option B might break our connections! Option C lets us stay close and communicate easily. I vote for Option C!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,Everyone seems to agree! Option C is definitely the best because it doesn't waste our time or make a mess. I'm so glad we all want the same thing!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
