74,3,3,talk,Shion,,The conclusion is reached. Any further debate would be a waste of time. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm just so glad we could all agree on this! It's going to be wonderful to have our own spots and stay close. I vote for Option C!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,I believe we have made the most logical and compassionate choice for the team. I cast my final vote for Option C.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shion,,The decision is final. Option C is the only choice that respects the physical and logical requirements of our work. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
